[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730862506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114811#issuecomment-3730862506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114811","id":3730862506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eYHGq","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T22:59:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T23:01:03Z","body":"I disabled the option to make scripts unique bc I didn't see a use for script duplication (at least for ones saved to disk)\n\nYou can see how `EditorNode::gather_resources` checks if it's a script to skip adding it to the hashmap, and on  `EditorResourcePicker::_update_resource()` it disables the `make_unique`s button visibility if the resource is a script\n\nWe can remove those checks altogether if making a script unique should be available regardless of its state or check if it's built-in to gather it and enable the button's visibility ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730862506/reactions","tot